.TH "REUSE" "1" "Dec 17, 2025" "6.2.0" "reuse"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
reuse \- A tool for compliance with the REUSE recommendations
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBreuse\fP [\fIoptions\fP] <command>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBreuse\fP is a helper tool for the REUSE initiative. Its main
functionality in \fBreuse\-lint(1) \%<https://\:reuse\:.readthedocs\:.io/\:en/\:v6\:.2\:.0/\:man/\:reuse-lint\:.html>\fP is to verify whether a project is
compliant with the REUSE Specification. It also contains an array of convenience
functions to enable developers to become compliant.
.sp
For more information on how to use reuse beyond a reference of the command\-line
options, see the accompanying documentation or read it at
\%<https://\:reuse\:.readthedocs\:.io>\&. For further information about REUSE, see
\%<https://\:reuse\:.software>\&.
.SH DETAILS
.sp
When searching for copyright and licensing tags inside of files, the tool does
not strictly limit itself to the header comment as prescribed by the
specification. It searches the entire file for REUSE information, whether in
comments or not. This makes sure that the tool can parse any type of plain\-text
file, even if the comment style is not recognised.
.sp
The tool does not verify the correctness of copyright notices. If it finds any
line containing \(aq©\(aq, \(aqCopyright\(aq, or \(aqSPDX\-FileCopyrightText:\(aq, then the tag and
everything following it is considered a valid copyright notice, even if the
copyright notice is not compliant with the specification.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Enable debug logging.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-suppress\-deprecation
Hide deprecation warnings.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-include\-submodules
Do not ignore Git submodules; they are treated as though they are part of the
project. This is not strictly compliant with the specification.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-include\-meson\-subprojects
Do not ignore Meson subprojects (i.e. the \fBsubprojects\fP directory in the
root of the project); they are treated as though they are part of the project.
This is not strictly compliant with the specification.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-no\-multiprocessing
Disable multiprocessing performance enhancer. This may be useful when
debugging.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-root PATH
Set the root of the project to PATH. Normally this defaults to the root of the
current working directory\(aqs VCS repository, or to the current working
directory.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-help
Display help and exit. If no command is provided, this option is implied.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-version
Display the version and exit.
.UNINDENT
.SH "محیط (ENVIRONMENT)"
.sp
\fBreuse\fP respects the following environment variables.
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B REUSE_ENCODING_MODULE
Instead of automatically picking the best module to detect the encodings of
files, \fBreuse\fP will use the module defined here. Its value must be
\fBpython\-magic\fP, \fBfile\-magic\fP, \fBcharset_normalizer\fP, or \fBchardet\fP\&.
.UNINDENT
.SH COMMANDS
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \fBreuse\-annotate(1) \%<https://\:reuse\:.readthedocs\:.io/\:en/\:v6\:.2\:.0/\:man/\:reuse-annotate\:.html>\fP
Add REUSE information to files.
.TP
.B \fBreuse\-convert\-dep5(1) \%<https://\:reuse\:.readthedocs\:.io/\:en/\:v6\:.2\:.0/\:man/\:reuse-convert-dep5\:.html>\fP
Convert \fB\&.reuse/dep5\fP to \fBREUSE.toml\fP\&.
.TP
.B \fBreuse\-download(1) \%<https://\:reuse\:.readthedocs\:.io/\:en/\:v6\:.2\:.0/\:man/\:reuse-download\:.html>\fP
Download license files.
.TP
.B \fBreuse\-lint(1) \%<https://\:reuse\:.readthedocs\:.io/\:en/\:v6\:.2\:.0/\:man/\:reuse-lint\:.html>\fP
Verify whether a project is compliant with the REUSE Specification.
.TP
.B \fBreuse\-lint\-file(1) \%<https://\:reuse\:.readthedocs\:.io/\:en/\:v6\:.2\:.0/\:man/\:reuse-lint-file\:.html>\fP
Verify whether individual files are compliant with the REUSE Specification.
.TP
.B \fBreuse\-spdx(1) \%<https://\:reuse\:.readthedocs\:.io/\:en/\:v6\:.2\:.0/\:man/\:reuse-spdx\:.html>\fP
Generate SPDX bill of materials.
.TP
.B \fBreuse\-supported\-licenses(1) \%<https://\:reuse\:.readthedocs\:.io/\:en/\:v6\:.2\:.0/\:man/\:reuse-supported-licenses\:.html>\fP
Print a list of supported licenses.
.UNINDENT
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Free Software Foundation Europe
